feat: initial commit - STM32F103C8 IoT environmental monitoring device

- Core: STM32F103C8 (Cortex-M3) with CMSIS + Standard Peripheral Library
- Sensors: DHT11 (temp/humidity), ADC (MQ-2/MQ-7 gas), DS1302 (RTC), HC-SR501 (PIR)
- Display: 0.96" OLED (I2C)
- Actuators: PWM LED (breathing mode), BEEP alarm
- Networking: ESP8266 Wi-Fi + MQTT + OneNET cloud platform
- Controls: GPIO key scanning, key EXTI
